{"kp_id": "zj-040.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-040", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "委中多汗不宜灸，宜放血针刺；治诸皮肤病及牛皮癣，为解毒大穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl40"], "chapter_id": "zj-040.c01", "evidence_quote": "都不不不揪的好，都放血下针", "seg_from": 7, "seg_to": 12, "start_s": 47.56, "end_s": 97.535, "citation": {"youtube_id": "ZXVjQwyr4Ho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXVjQwyr4Ho&t=47s", "series": "zj", "episode": 40, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Discipline\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 40", "start_s": 47.56, "end_s": 97.53}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "尾中/伪中=委中；不揪=不灸", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-040.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-040", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "承山与肛门相应，治痔效著，可配孔最止血止痛；下针宜深透至骨。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl57", "acupoint.lu6"], "chapter_id": "zj-040.c01", "evidence_quote": "陈山是很有名的痔疮的大学", "seg_from": 32, "seg_to": 95, "start_s": 188.46, "end_s": 570.535, "citation": {"youtube_id": "ZXVjQwyr4Ho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXVjQwyr4Ho&t=188s", "series": "zj", "episode": 40, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Discipline\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 40", "start_s": 188.46, "end_s": 570.53}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "陈山/乘三=承山；孔坠/孔罪=孔最", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-040.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-040", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "飞扬在承山下约一寸再外开一寸，为膀胱经络穴；可强健下肢。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl58", "concept.luo_xue", "meridian.bl"], "chapter_id": "zj-040.c01", "evidence_quote": "飞扬呢就是膀胱经的，主要是落穴", "seg_from": 101, "seg_to": 109, "start_s": 603.72, "end_s": 657.905, "citation": {"youtube_id": "ZXVjQwyr4Ho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXVjQwyr4Ho&t=603s", "series": "zj", "episode": 40, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Discipline\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 40", "start_s": 603.72, "end_s": 657.9}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "落穴=络穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-040.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-040", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "昆仑在外踝与大筋间，擅治项背痛；亦可催下胞衣，孕妇慎用。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl60"], "chapter_id": "zj-040.c02", "evidence_quote": "专门治疗项背痛，后项项背痛的哦，很有名的穴道", "seg_from": 141, "seg_to": 186, "start_s": 832.5, "end_s": 1084.335, "citation": {"youtube_id": "ZXVjQwyr4Ho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXVjQwyr4Ho&t=832s", "series": "zj", "episode": 40, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Discipline\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 40", "start_s": 832.5, "end_s": 1084.34}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-040.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-040", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "仆参在昆仑下近跟骨，治足跟痛。京骨为膀胱原穴，治剧烈头痛等。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.bl61", "acupoint.bl64", "concept.yuan_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-040.c02", "evidence_quote": "很多人呢足跟痛，这个人脚后跟痛", "seg_from": 188, "seg_to": 271, "start_s": 1100.447, "end_s": 1582.952, "citation": {"youtube_id": "ZXVjQwyr4Ho", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXVjQwyr4Ho&t=1100s", "series": "zj", "episode": 40, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Discipline\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 40", "start_s": 1100.45, "end_s": 1582.95}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "蒲参=仆参；元穴=原穴", "source": "llm_read"}
